  "instructions": [
    "Peel and chop the bellflower roots into 1-inch pieces.",
    "Mince the ginger, galangal, and lemongrass.",
    "In a large pot, combine the coconut milk, rice vinegar, water, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chopped bellflower roots and the minced ginger, galangal, and lemongrass to the pot.",
    "Cover the pot and steam over medium heat until the bellflower roots are tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve the steamed bellflower roots hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Refrigerate any leftovers for up to 3 days.",
    "To reheat, steam the leftovers over medium heat until warmed through.",
